```plantuml
@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

autonumber

title System Sequence Diagram (SSD) - US07

actor "Port Authority Officer" as PAO
participant ":System" as System

activate PAO

    PAO -> System : requests to manage a representative
    activate System
        System --> PAO : collects inputs for selected fields (name, citizenId, nationality, email, phone, action)
    deactivate System

    PAO -> System : provides inputs
    activate System
        System --> PAO : displays "Representative edited successfully: <repId>"
    deactivate System

deactivate PAO

@enduml
```
